<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7863.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Edle, Ehrenveste, Fromme, Fürsichtige, Ersame
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wyse</unclear>, innsonders günstige Herren, guotte Fründ,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydt</unclear>- und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pundtsgnossen</unclear>, Eüch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seÿge</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> fründtlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbietung</unclear> aller
<lb n="5"/>ehren, liebs und guots, bevor.
<lb n="6"/>Demnach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füegendt</unclear> wir E. V. Ehrv. F. E. W. zuoer-
<lb n="7"/>nemmen, daß uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear> den tag seines datums, allß
<lb n="8"/>wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhatßwÿß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> einanderen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versampt</unclear> gewesen,
<lb n="9"/>für unß kommen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear> ist, der ehrenvest,
<lb n="10"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> lieber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitrhat</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statthogt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Cuonradt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Krauß</unclear></persName>, allß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehevogt</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwerer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewesnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerin</unclear>, frawen <persName resp="#ner">Helena
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lagin</unclear></persName>, an statt und in nammen derselben, und klagt-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿß</unclear> fürbringen lassen, allß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> absterben ihres
<lb n="15"/>vor disem gehabten lieben ehewürths <persName resp="#ner">Gerhart
<lb n="16"/>Groben</persName> seeligen zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-33" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Liechtensteig</placeName>, sie mit ihren
<lb n="17"/>beeden ihro vor disem zuogeordneten vögten,
<lb n="18"/>nahmens <persName resp="#ner">Heinrich Spießer</persName> und <persName resp="#ner">Ruodolph Groben</persName>,
<lb n="19"/>wegen erstgedachts ihres ehewürths, und dessen
<lb n="20"/>geliebten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vatters</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lux</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Groben</unclear></persName> seeligen ver-
<lb n="21"/>lassenschafft, an dem appellation <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> be-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meldtem</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-33" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Liechtensteig</unclear></placeName> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rechtfertigung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwach</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sen</unclear>; Daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neülich</unclear> daselbsten von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> appel-
<lb n="24"/>lation richter und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beÿsitzeren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söliche</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unrechtmessige</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hochbeschwerliche</unclear> urtel <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wider</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>sie gesprochen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußgefelt</unclear> worden seige, beÿ
<lb n="27"/>deren ein jeder, so der sachen beschaffenheit nur
<lb n="28"/>ein geringe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssenschafft</unclear> habe, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handtgrifflich</unclear> zuo-
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verspüren</unclear> seige, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eintweders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merckliche</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">partheÿlichkeit</unclear>, oder sonsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">privat</unclear> affect,
<lb n="31"/>wegen der religion, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">under</unclear> geloffen sein müße.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7864.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/>Dann obgleich woll besagte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>: <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Helena</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Tigin</unclear></persName> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear>-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erchschidenlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mahlen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sowoll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innes</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstens</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">knecht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> bemelte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vögt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-33" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Liechtenstaig</unclear></placeName> be-
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gert</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unpartheyischen</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biderbsleueten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innemens</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgebens</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raittung</unclear>, und sölche rechnung geben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lassend</unclear>, da-
<lb n="38"/>mit man in specie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wuesen</unclear> möge, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear>, wie und
<lb n="39"/>wohin sye daß seinig verwennedt, welches aber
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inme</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wieder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alles</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgeschlagen</unclear> worden.
<lb n="41"/>Zuo deme auch so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eberschweileren</unclear></placeName> dahin
<lb n="42"/>gehalten worden, daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">füer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inme</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwecher</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwager</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">viell</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unrichtige</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ungich</unclear>-
<lb n="44"/>tige und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbkandtliche</unclear> schulden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">namblich</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bandtlin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gmoosern</unclear></persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-141" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vznach</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> mehr
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezalen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müessen</unclear>.
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Derowegen</unclear> an uns sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diemuetflechigs</unclear> pitt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wier</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wölltend</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ers</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. mit disem
<lb n="49"/>schreiben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früendtlcihen</unclear>, Eydt- und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pundtsgnössischs</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuechen</unclear>, dieselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wölltend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">füerderung</unclear> der
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">justitien</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehenlichen</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesandtschaft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bei</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grt</unclear>. sollicitieren und
<lb n="53"/>anhalten, daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dieselbig</unclear> per decretum besagte
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beede</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vögt</unclear> dahin halte und vermöge, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inbeweederers</unclear> vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Helena</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Tigin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwandten</unclear>,
<lb n="56"/>oder sonst vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> ehrlichen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">biderbleüeten</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>rechnung und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">raittung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebendt</unclear>.
<lb n="58"/>Wann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nuen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> diß sein pitt nit können
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abschlagen</unclear> noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwaiggeren</unclear>.
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gelangt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demnach</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ers</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ganz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früendtlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydt</unclear>- und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pundtsgnössigs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dieselben</unclear> wöllend besagten supplicanten in
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7865.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrem</unclear> begeren großguenstig willfahren, und
<lb n="64"/>denselben, darzue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuog</unclear> und recht habend,
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befüerersam</unclear> sein, darmit sye uan wehr zuo
<lb n="66"/>dem ihrigen auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">komen</unclear> mögendt.
<lb n="67"/>Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uuß</unclear> solchs in der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gleichen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehreren</unclear>
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> guettwillig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zubeschulden</unclear> und
<lb n="69"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuuerdienen</unclear>.
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Göttlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bewahrung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> beiderseits woll
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befehlend</unclear>. Datum den <origDate when="1618-06-16" resp="#ner">6. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">16</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Juny</unclear>. Anno 1618</origDate>.
<lb n="72"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stattuogt</unclear> und Rhatt
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mayenfeldt</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7866.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="74"/>Den Edlen, Frommen, Vesten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fuersichtigen</unclear>, Ersamen
<lb n="75"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weyßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrn</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear>
